e 'X' represents 59 and 'T' represents 55. The final remainder is 0, indica=
ting the end of the conversion.  The diagram visually connects each divisio=
n step with a line, showing the flow of the calculation from the initial de=
cimal number to its base-62 equivalent." loading=3D"lazy" width=3D"500" hei=
